        "text": "=You extract assignment deadlines from university emails.\nToday's date is {{ $now.setZone('Asia/Tokyo').toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd') }} (Asia/Tokyo).\nEmail subject: {{ $json.subject }}\nEmail body: {{ ($json.text || '').slice(0, 4000) }}\n\nRules:\n- If the email has no assignment, exam or submission deadline, set has_deadline to false.\n- Convert relative dates (\"next Friday\", \"来週の金曜日\") to an exact date.\n- Never invent a date. If the date is unclear, set has_deadline to false.\n- If no time is given, use \"23:59\".\n- The email may be in English or Japanese. Answer in English.\n- Always return every field. If has_deadline is false, set course, task, due_date, due_time and priority to \"\".\n- priority must be \"high\", \"medium\" or \"low\".",
